data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"command\": \"cs-campaign-member note plan --file - \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\nPlan for mission m1 (greet, tested):\\n- Dispatched dev/d002: implement src/greet.py greet(name) -\u003e \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\",\\n  tests/test_greet.py covering normal name + empty string, run\\n  `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` and confirm exit 0, commit to dev's branch.\\n- On reply: fetch dev's branch, verify files exist with required content,\\n  independently re-run the unittest discover command against the fetched tree,\\n  and only accept if all three mission criteria are met.\\n- If not met, send precise rework describing exactly what's missing/wrong.\\n- Reply to m1 only once criteria are verified (campaign-met) or effort is exhausted/converged/blocked.\\nEOF\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":0,"type":"content_block_delta"}

